c-shiji-067-disciples:p002","quote":"孔子之所嚴事：於周則老子；於衞，蘧伯玉；於齊，晏平仲；於楚，老萊子；於鄭，子產；於魯，孟公綽。數稱臧文仲、柳下惠、銅鞮伯華、介山子然，孔子皆後之，不并世。"}],"rationale":"依篇內明示姓名字稱及局部問答暫接。吳越王稱按夫差句踐連續敘事；第71段夫子指原憲，第90段指代未定。傳易短何分田子莊何與楊何，傳授不當父子；引古人物保留傳說性。冉季字子產不接鄭子產，原憲子思不接孔子後世子思；名錄各條同字子徒、子聲、子上、皙等均保留不同候選，鄭國是此條人名。魯昭公夫人孟子不接戰國孟子。全152段明示姓名首輪已存，未名者、代詞、版本及跨篇身份待覆核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p002","text":"孔子之所嚴事：於周則老子；於衞，蘧伯玉；於齊，晏平仲；於楚，老萊子；於鄭，子產；於魯，孟公綽。數稱臧文仲、柳下惠、銅鞮伯華、介山子然，孔子皆後之，不并世。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m002-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"0xl_7ir_tmn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m002-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"老子","kind":"person","person_id":"crw_kww_5qn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m002-0016","start":16,"end":19,"surface":"蘧伯玉","kind":"person","person_id":"xd1_no8_2ar","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m002-0023","start":23,"end":26,"surface":"晏平仲","kind":"person","person_id":"whn_5w1_i1k","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m002-0030","start":30,"end":33,"surface":"老萊子","kind":"person","person_id":"1ot_coy_e83","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m002-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"子產","kind":"person","person_id":"bvk_gpk_f1b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m002-0043","start":43,"end":46,"surface":"孟公綽","kind":"person","person_id":"gze_eo7_lon","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m002-0049","start":49,"end":52,"surface":"臧文仲","kind":"person","person_id":"8zs_p2x_twj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m002-0053","start":53,"end":56,"surface":"柳下惠","kind":"person","person_id":"xg5_2en_bvd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m0